TRAMES — which licence covers what

This repository holds parts under different licences.

client/     The TRAMES Android app, a fork of OsmAnd.
            Code: GNU General Public License, version 3 (GPLv3).
            OsmAnd's own notice, kept verbatim: client/LICENSE.
            OsmAnd's artwork (client/OsmAnd/res) is CC-BY-NC-ND 4.0, and that notice
            warns that some of it is under a proprietary licence; see
            client/TRAMES-NOTICE.md for how TRAMES handles both.

server/     The offline map pipeline, the camera service and the study's routing
            server. MIT licence: server/LICENSE.

research/   The measurement study. MIT licence: research/LICENSE.

Data        Camera and map data © OpenStreetMap contributors, available under the
            Open Database Licence (ODbL): https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright
            Other datasets the study reads, such as Census LEHD LODES, keep their own
            terms.

TRAMES's own code is Copyright (c) 2026 Kara Zajac.
